Subject: [PATCH 144/572] feat(stm32mp2): add DDR firmware OID

To manage DDR firmware with TRUSTED_BOARD_BOOT, we need a dedicated
HASH OID. It will be used by cert_tool, and added in STM32MP2
cot-descriptor device tree file.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/arm-trusted-firmware.git 1d99f8d43404f4a811ec033e0d2e0b1b9b13edbe feat(stm32mp2): add DDR firmware OID]
